  "releaseNotes": "0.4.2\n\nChanged\n- The alert has its notched look back as the default, as on the web: the 44px circle holding the icon nested in a bite cut from the message. The small circle inside the message that 0.4.0 brought is now the `inset` class (`Classes=\"info inset\"`); add it to keep that look.\n\nThe full list of 0.4.0 changes is on the 0.4.0 release.",
